あや(由比雅雪)","detail":"ロゴデザイン、OPムービー制作","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:141048","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"籐太","creatorId":"vndb:s847","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2155","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s847","name":"籐太","detail":"企画、サブディレクション","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:141313","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"株式会社キューン・プラント(quunplant)","creatorId":"vndb:s7417","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:17833","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7417","name":"株式会社キューン・プラント(quunplant)","detail":"背景","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:141797","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"北川晴","creatorId":"vndb:s1473","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2274","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1473","name":"北川晴","detail":"ディレクション","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:141799","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"ひうらまさこ","creatorId":"vndb:s916","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14682","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s916","name":"ひうらまさこ","detail":"ED曲「永遠の星座へ」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:141843","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"株式会社ワームスエンタテイメント(QLIE.net)","creatorId":"egs:creator:20329","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:20329","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:20329","name":"株式会社ワームスエンタテイメント(QLIE.net)","detail":"スクリプトエンジン QLiE","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:145777","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"西沢 はぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s394","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s394","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s394","name":"西沢 はぐみ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108260","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"籐太","creatorId":"vndb:s847","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s847","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s847","name":"籐太","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108262","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"籐太","creatorId":"vndb:s847","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s847","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s847","name":"籐太","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108263","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ひうら まさこ","creatorId":"vndb:s916","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s916","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s916","name":"ひうら まさこ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108264","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"嵩夜 あや","creatorId":"vndb:s1162","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1162","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1162","name":"嵩夜 あや","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108265","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"北川 晴","creatorId":"vndb:s1473","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1473","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1473","name":"HARE","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108266","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"山下 慎一狼","creatorId":"vndb:s4927","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4927","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4927","name":"山下 慎一狼","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:108267","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c22948","characterName":"岩長ノ銀杏媛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27279","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102432"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3676"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22948"},"originalCharacterName":"岩長ノ銀杏媛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Iwanaga no Ichiyou Hime – also known as the rumored horrendous goddess is the main heroine of the game. She became Haruto's wife and \"master\" after saving his life in the mountains, also exchanging vows with him by performing an ancient matrimonial ritual. She reveals that Haruto actually died on that day, but she saved him by transforming him into her “familiar”, which means Haruto needs to fulfill tasks given to him by his master in order to receive more of her energy, or else, he will end up dead. Since Ichiyou believes in the “old ways” where women were like servants for their husbands, she doesn’t wish to order Haruto around and asks him to choose which orders she has to give him. This is because she enclosured herself on those mountains for centuries, which means she also suffers from anachronism. Her speech is also influenced by this, as people hardly understand her at first."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"During the ancient times when gods were closer to humans, the standards of beauty were completely different, which means huge lips, tiny eyes, flat chest and big nose were the ideal elements to a woman’s face, while someone like Ichiyou – whose got complete opposite features – was constantly insulted and humiliated. She is also treated like the ugliest person ever during ancient Japan, like she was so ugly for those people, that she was treated like a freaking monster."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From gangrelion's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22948"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛ニートの恋の神、銀杏さん。お嬢様風の黒髪ロング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつでも濡れたように、しっとりした髪質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高貴な出自を想像させる尊大な態度と言葉遣いで話すが、好きな気持ちを素直に表せない困ったちゃんでもある。実は、２０００年間も山奥に引きこもっていた恋愛ニートで、どうやって男性と接すればいいかさえ、全くわかっていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また自分のことをブスだと強く思い込んでいて、長い髪だけが自慢である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"というのも、昔の美人と現代の美人ではまったく顔立ちが違うためで、主人公のこともブス専の変態だと思い込んでいる。もちろん、現代の感覚で言えば、充分過ぎる程、おふつくしい方である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3676","sourceWorkId":"19880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛ニートの恋の神。 お嬢様風の黒髪ロング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつでも濡れたように、しっとりした髪質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高貴な出自を想像させる尊大な態度と言葉遣いで話すが、好きな気持ちを素直に表せない困ったちゃんでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は2000年間も山奥に引きこもっていた恋愛ニートで、どうやって男性と接すればいいかまったく分かっていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また自分のことをブスだと強く思い込んでいて、長い髪だけが自慢である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"というのも、昔の美人と現代の美人ではまったく顔立ちが違うためで、主人公のこともブス専の変態だと思い込んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん現代の感覚で言えば、充分過ぎるほど おふつくしい方である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「主様の願いを叶え、お……お嫁さんになるために来てやったのであろ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27279"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c01f3474714853175147420418b8c9b62205bc54e43b71e0046bde3c15e9059.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e9c5322c3ade13a933e7f410ae3d16ee337d58061f4f58aea1ce6cdfcb3b4d9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:102432:27279:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22949","characterName":"鳳月 うらら","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27281","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102432"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3677"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22949"},"originalCharacterName":"鳳月 うらら","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Urara’s family is a traditional clan who has an alliance with the Kamimae family for ages, to the point they even live at the same temple. Consequently, Haruto is Urara’s childhood friend and she is in love with him for as long as she can remember. Sadly, she is really bad at this “love” thingy, since she is the type of girl who would constantly punch her beloved one in the face until he would stop hating her. “Clumsy” as she is with romance, she was the culprit who manipulated her’s and Haruto’s parents to send him to his death in the snowing mountains, only because the boy would only praise her hair. Obviously, she doesn’t feel bad for the result, since she doesn’t believe in Haruto’s story, after all, she happens to be an atheist…even though she works as a shrine maiden at their temple. Contrary to Ichiyou, she longs for a one-sided relationship with Haruto, where she is always on top, which is why she never gives ears to what her childhood friend has to say, which is why her catchphrases are “Shut your mouth, Haruto” and “Do sleep-talking once you’re asleep”. She is also a huge pervert who loves eroges and often plays them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From gangrelion's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22949"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無神論者の巫女、うらら。委員長タイプの黒髪ロング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手入れの行き届いたさらさらヘア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にとっては幼馴染みでもある。主に社務所に併設されている休憩所でお茶を出している。そのとき、巫女服の上にエプロンをして出てくるため、地元では『巫女さんカフェ』として有名らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、徹底したリアリストである彼女は神の存在を信じていない。本当は紅茶の方が好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"密かに鬼軍曹とあだ名されるほどルールや常識に厳しいが、なぜか１８禁美少女ゲームにはまっているのを、主人公だけは知っている。そのため、しょっちゅうアキバのショップまでパシらされている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3677","sourceWorkId":"19880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無神論者の巫女。 委員長タイプの黒髪ロング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手入れの行き届いたさらさらヘア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にとっては幼なじみ。 主に社務所に併設されている休憩所でお茶を出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女服の上にエプロンをして出てくるため、地元では “巫女さんカフェ” として有名らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当は紅茶のほうが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"徹底したリアリストで神の存在を信じておらず、密かに鬼軍曹とあだ名されるほどルールや常識に厳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、なぜか18禁美少女ゲームにハマっているのを、主人公だけは知っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、しょっちゅうアキバのショップまでパシらされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「貴方が結婚ですって？　それも私以外とだなんて……寝言は寝て言いなさいっ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45a211b488eba38f25113ec41dac0a110b4ca0e3843141864ed340f16672c93d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5d9f7ba643ee5bfcf9249764d7872cc27766259a0c0b1a67e4340d2bee2a7e3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s285","name":"東かりん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:102432:27281:5905:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22950","characterName":"中津国女ノ咲耶媛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27282","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102432"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3678"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22950"},"originalCharacterName":"中津国女ノ咲耶媛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nakatsukunime no Sakuya Hime is Ichiyou’s little sister, and opposing her sister, she is a vastly known entity who represents beauty and works with the bounds of love. Instead of being arrogant about her appearance and status, she is actually very mature and selfless, which is connected to how she loves and respects her older sister more than anything, instead of showing disdain for her, like every other deity did in the old days. She is a siscon, but instead of treating Haruto badly, she accepts him almost immediately as she identifies him as “one who is loved by the gods” (people born with exceptional spiritual capabilities to easily communicate with the supernatural). She also judges Haruto’s love to be pure and believes that he would certainly be able to make her sister happy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From gangrelion's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22950"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼れる妹神、咲耶さん。ツインテールの黒髪ロング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉神と同じく、しっとり柔らかな髪質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもにこやかに笑い、常に男性を立てる聞き上手で、誰からも好かれる性格である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっと行方不明だった姉を心配して姿を現すなど、容姿だけでなく、性格まで美人。だが、あまりに完璧過ぎて、姉の銀杏にとってはトラウマ的存在である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりしてるようで、実はドＳな一面を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人気のある神様なので、今までその時代に合わせて何度も転生している。そのため、ちゃんと現代風の美人である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに今の転生体では処女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3678","sourceWorkId":"19880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼れる妹神さま。 ツインテールの黒髪ロング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉神と同じく、しっとり柔らかな髪質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもにこやかに笑い、常に男性を立てる聞き上手で、誰からも好かれる性格である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっと行方不明だった姉を心配して姿を現すなど、容姿だけでなく性格まで美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、あまりに完璧過ぎて、姉の銀杏にとってはトラウマ的存在である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりしてるようで、実はドSな一面を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人気のある神様なので、今までその時代に合わせて何度も転生している。 そのため、ちゃんと現代風の美人が分かっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに今の転生体では処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふふ、お姉様ったら可愛い」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27282"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcffc11c2be2db3de3aaad357fef8011eac521c8386e06ea832226cb1b7c1634.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f85077b2c81c064a1b6cbb7801be7d05d0ff8056bf2e54c68fb1abc7e7ba5b0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎真実","creatorId":"vndb:s199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s199","name":"尾崎 真実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:102432:27282:8165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22951","characterName":"祟女 水葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27283","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102432"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3679"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22951"},"originalCharacterName":"祟女 水葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mizuha is a chuunibyou, but who wouldn’t be one when you got a surname that sounds like “cursed eyes”? Likewise, she believes to be possessed by the Death God “Gouma”, from who she claims to have received the “death-touch” and the power to see visions of future deaths. Those powers are supposed to manifests in her right eye and right hand, which she hides with an eye-patch for medical use and some bandages. By taking those off, it’s revealed she uses a colored contact-lens and some doodles she did with a magic pencil. The first and last time she meets with the protagonist is when she was performing a ritual to get rid of Gouma, ON HIS TEMPLE! She lit a huge bonfire and screamed a bunch of gibberish during the night, which made easier for them to call the police on her, and that was it for her…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, in an alternative timeline, Haruto decides to take on the matter himself by pretending to exorcise Gouma from her and charging money for the job. Unfortunately, Haruto’s plan backfires on him when Mizuha falls in love with him for how cool and mystical he was during the ritual and begs to become his disciple."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From gangrelion's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22951"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"厨二病の水葉ちゃん。漆黒のおかっぱは闇の者ゆえ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒い髪をさらに黒く染めた髪は、指通り滑らか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死神・業魔（ゴーマ）の力を宿すゆえ、右手と右目を喰われ、いつ暴走してもおかしくない状態にある年下の少女（すべて自称）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眼帯＆包帯＋ゴス。主人公以外にはマジ○チ扱いされているが、話してみると案外、普通の明るい女の子で、ただ単に発言が痛いだけのようである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"境内で謎の儀式を行っていたところを通報され、警察に補導されそうになる。だが、主人公だけは彼女の言い分を信じて、お祓いまでしてあげた。ただし料金は取った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以来、なぜか懐かれてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3679","sourceWorkId":"19880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"厨二病患者。 漆黒のおかっぱは闇の者ゆえ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒い髪をさらに黒く染めた髪は、指通り滑らか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死神・業魔（ゴーマ）の力を宿すゆえ、右手と右目を喰われ、いつ暴走してもおかしくない状態にある年下の少女 （すべて自称）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眼帯＆包帯＋ゴス。 主人公以外にはマジ○チ扱いされているが、話してみると普通の明るい女の子で、ただ単に発言が痛いだけのようである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"境内で謎の儀式を行っていたところを通報され、警察に補導されそうになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、主人公だけは彼女の言い分を信じて、お祓いまでしてあげた。 ただし料金は取った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以来、なぜか懐かれてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「くッ鎮まれ、業魔！　お願いです、ししょー……ま、また私にお祓いを！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27283"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21d9a687795f55b34089000eaa30da68706bccd8290dd583aafe10f34a7d9322.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32ae254e0c193ed581f8424a066b3298326663d0f184ee4b537e44068d6cb586.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩﨑春奈","creatorId":"vndb:s878","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s878","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s878","name":"岩﨑 春奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:102432:27283:11648:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c106368","characterName":"此花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c106368"},"originalCharacterName":"此花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45652c2bbc8f158